s—especially if you’ve got stronger legs, glutes, and a small waist. No awkward fits, no compromises—just jeans that move with you instead of against you.<\/p>"}},"item_M7ecB8":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Are CURVJEANS stretchy?","content":"<p>YES! Our stretch is like magic! They hold their shape (no baggy knees!) but move with you all day. Dance, sit, run - these babies won't let you down.<br\/><br\/>Plus, they're actually comfy enough to wear all day!<\/p>"}},"item_btxATh":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Will they stay up without a belt?","content":"<p>Yes! CURVJEANS are made with a special waistband that fits snug at the waist—no more sliding down or constant adjusting. You can finally ditch the belt.<\/p>"}},"item_Ckt4Wt":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"When will I receive my order?","content":"<p>Can't wait to get your perfect jeans? We get it! Your CURVJEANS will arrive in 5-6 working days. We'll keep you updated every step of the way! 📦✨<\/p>"}},"item_XkAAKm":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Can I pay later?","content":"<p>Yep! Just select Klarna at checkout and you can try now, pay later—no extra fees. Super easy, super safe.<\/p>"}},"item_yrACzw":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Do you ship internationally?","content":"<p>Yes we do!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_YhyjJt","item_THfNfg","item_7egfLh","item_kJGmng","item_M7ecB8","item_btxATh","item_Ckt4Wt","item_XkAAKm","item_yrACzw"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"<p>Your perfect-fit questions answered!<\/p>","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"Our customer support is available Monday to Friday: 8am-8:30pm.","answer_time":"Average answer time: 24h","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"custom_liquid_ahfUHi":{"type